#: ui/help-info.slint:3
msgctxt "HelpInfo"
msgid ""
"1. When you run the app, the system current adapters are loaded to the list "
"in \"Adapters\", or you can click \"Refresh\" to reload.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. 当打开App时，系统当前的网络适配器会自动加载到中间的\"适配器\"区域，你也可"
"以点击\"刷新\"按钮来手动刷新。\n"

#: ui/help-info.slint:4
msgctxt "HelpInfo"
msgid "2. Choose one of the adapters to see details.\n"
msgstr "2. 选择一个网络适配器，在右侧区域可以看到详细信息。\n"

#: ui/help-info.slint:5
msgctxt "HelpInfo"
msgid ""
"3. Select one in step 2, then click \"Load selected\". The adapter info is "
"loaded to the left area.\n"
msgstr ""
"3. 在步骤2. 中选择一项，然后点击\"加载选中项\"按钮，适配器信息会加载到左侧区"
"域。\n"

#: ui/help-info.slint:6
msgctxt "HelpInfo"
msgid ""
"4. Do some change in the left area, click \"Apply\" or \"Save\" when you "
"finished, or \"Load selected\" to discard the changes.\n"
msgstr ""
"4. 在左侧区域中按照你的需要进行修改，可以点击\"应用\"按钮来使其生效，或点击"
"\"保存\"按钮来保存，也可以点击\"加载选中项\"按钮放弃更改。\n"

#: ui/help-info.slint:7
msgctxt "HelpInfo"
msgid ""
"     1) The app support multiple IP when \"DHCP on\" is unchecked. Each line "
"represent one address. Please fill the \"IP\" and \"netmask\" list with same "
"count, while each IP must match a netmask.\n"
msgstr ""
"   1) 当\"启用DHCP\"未选中时，可以对一个适配器配置多个IP。\"地址清单\"中的每"
"一行代表一个地址，IP地址和子网掩码必须是一一配对的，所以\"地址清单\"和\"子网"
"掩码\"中的行数必须保持一致；\n"

#: ui/help-info.slint:8
msgctxt "HelpInfo"
msgid "     2) \"gateway\" and \"DNS list\" also support multiple address.\n"
msgstr "   2) \"网关\" 和 \"DNS列表\" 同样支持配置多个。\n"

#: ui/help-info.slint:10
msgctxt "HelpInfo"
msgid ""
"If you saved some items in step 4, then you can choose and select them, like "
"step 2 & 3."
msgstr ""
"如果你在步骤4. 中保存了一些配置，你可以在\"已保存参数\"区域中选择它们，并执行"
"类似步骤2. 和步骤3. 的操作。"

